{"channelId":"UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","row":["The Royal College of Pathologists",33800,"The Royal College of Pathologists is a charity with over 13,000 members worldwide. The majority of members are doctors and scientists working in hospitals and universities in the UK. The College oversees the training of pathologists and scientists working in 17 different specialties, which include cellular pathology, haematology, clinical biochemistry and medical microbiology. Although some pathologists work in laboratories, many work directly with patients in hospitals and the community. Together, they are involved in the majority of all diagnoses and play an important role in disease prevention, treatment, and monitoring. If you have ever had a blood test, cervical smear or tissue biopsy, a pathologist will have been involved in your care.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:53.547Z","channelId":"UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"06e8362f22cadef16182848d03561abf02a8e248f8a73348529bee3f2eb3ca29","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ac5e415281a8055aa96973a88dbcdac74e68d8624512c35e97bbe7ffe8338893"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:53.547Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":33800,"raw":"33.8K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMgRjbmtowv4LAwvFiPKbOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:53.547Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，